mahfin-desktop (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Mahfin Desktop release, forked from Jellyfin Desktop 2.0.0.
  * Rebrand throughout: application name, icons, app ID, config paths.
  * Default to the Mahfin server, so the connect screen is skipped.
  * Playback is handled by libmpv rather than the browser, which direct-plays
    Matroska, HEVC, 10-bit, DTS, TrueHD and multi-track audio without asking
    the server to transcode.

 -- Samriddha <sunny.patel@vovance.com>  Wed, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0530
